1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,680
I'm impressed she managed to catch up to us.

2
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,440
Not that it matters, though.

3
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,380
Now, come on.

4
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:30,120
We mustn't leave our boat waiting.

5
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,240
Chosha-sumu!

6
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:33,800
Hey!

7
00:00:57,380 --> 00:01:04,540
Oh, God.

8
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,340
Right on time.

9
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:20,460
Oh, God.

10
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:22,260
Right on time.

11
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:24,600
Liu Guang?

12
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:26,240
What the hell?

13
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:37,340
The riverside?

14
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:39,080
How did I get here?

15
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:40,680
You hurt?

16
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:50,360
She's getting away!

17
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:58,260
Get her!

18
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:03,620
Liu Guang!

19
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:04,460
Go, go on!

20
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:26,480
Why did he get on the boat?

21
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,480
Why did he get on the boat?

22
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:35,480
Captain Xiao! Wang Zhan!

23
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:39,480
Hurry! Take her for rescue!

24
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,480
Captain Xiao! Are you okay?

25
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:45,480
What happened to you, sir?

26
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:49,480
Go get the rest of the guys!

27
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,480
Tell every damn cop in this city!

28
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:57,480
Daddy, don't stop busting down doors until we find Li Tien Xie!

29
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:09,480
Well, should I play host?

30
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:17,480
There's no such thing as flawless.

31
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:19,480
But it's nice when plans go smoothly.

32
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,480
What's he doing here?

33
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,480
What's he doing here?

34
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:46,360
What's he doing here?

35
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,280
Well, he crashed my exit.

36
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:53,360
I was just going to leave with nothing, but then he grabbed me.

37
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:56,020
They couldn't have known about the rendezvous.

38
00:03:57,300 --> 00:03:59,180
And yet, here we are!

39
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,600
What the hell was he thinking?

40
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:10,860
None of this makes any sense.

41
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:13,200
It was just you?

42
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,040
Yes, us three.

43
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:18,380
And then he'd lock the door when we heard the crash.

44
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,440
The surveillance?

45
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,360
We checked.

46
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:27,240
The camera spotted Mr. Liu exiting his room after we had rushed in to help.

47
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:32,680
With all the commotion of the broken window and trying to get into the room, we didn't notice him.

48
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,100
Captain Xiao!

49
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,760
Any news on Liu Guang?

50
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:42,460
Easy. Catch your breath.

51
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,880
We don't know much.

52
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:46,040
Just that he snuck out on his own.

53
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:49,840
That said, the bigger question is why.

54
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:51,380
Damn it.

55
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,500
This shouldn't have happened.

56
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,280
But I let her possess me.

57
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,640
That's not your fault, okay?

58
00:04:58,420 --> 00:04:59,860
No one knew what would happen.

59
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:02,900
I've got men scouring the city.

60
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,440
Just wait.

61
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:05,600
All right?

62
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:09,040
We'll find Liu Guang and Li Tianxie.

63
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,500
This case is top priority.

64
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,200
And I've found something big.

65
00:05:20,580 --> 00:05:21,380
Chen Xin.

66
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:24,960
Chen Xin was lead on the case?

67
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,820
And it gets worse.

68
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,920
The murder of Liu Lan and her husband?

69
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:32,740
That was his last case before he quit.

70
00:05:32,740 --> 00:05:51,080
It wasn't long after his resignation that the files for Li Tianxie and Li Tianxien mysteriously vanished.

71
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:52,720
But they never existed.

72
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:57,160
My guess, Chen Xin is still tied up in all of this.

73
00:05:57,160 --> 00:06:00,800
That could be why he sent men after you.

74
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:02,900
And why he'd be working with Liu Jing.

75
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:05,940
I have some eyes on him.

76
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,320
But we can't do anything yet.

77
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,500
We need more.

78
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,360
Be careful.

79
00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:15,140
All you've done is secure the scene, correct?

80
00:06:16,420 --> 00:06:17,560
And nothing more?

81
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:18,760
Right.

82
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,220
We did a rough search when we swept the room.

83
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,520
Didn't touch anything.

84
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,400
And there?

85
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:29,280
We didn't get to it, sir.

86
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:34,160
They probably hid in here after breaking the window.

87
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:35,280
Waited.

88
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,520
And snuck out.

89
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,000
About 20 minutes later,

90
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:42,100
he catches up to you at the river.

91
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,240
Not a single second wasted.

92
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:46,260
Suggests a plan.

93
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:49,740
Oh.

94
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,380
Liu Guang also sent me an address,

95
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,560
which is why I went to the river in the first place.

96
00:06:56,400 --> 00:07:01,160
Hey, this his phone?

97
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,680
Yeah, that's his.

98
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,340
Well then,

99
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:07,820
seems like he's leaving us breadcrumbs.

100
00:07:08,820 --> 00:07:10,420
Do either of you know his password?

101
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:12,060
Yeah, I do.

102
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:16,380
091305.

103
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:17,520
All right, we're in.

104
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:20,140
Can't believe he trusted you with his password.

105
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:22,860
Is that number significant to him somehow?

106
00:07:22,860 --> 00:07:24,820
Maybe?

107
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:24,860
Maybe.

108
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:26,740
He doesn't know I know it.

109
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,080
Say what?

110
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,100
There's just a missed call from you.

111
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,760
What about his photos?

112
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:36,420
Huh?

113
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:38,720
That's the view from here.

114
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:41,020
But why would he take this?

115
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:42,580
Hang on.

116
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:43,640
Could he…

117
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,720
I think I know why.

118
00:07:47,180 --> 00:07:49,400
It's for you to go back to that moment.

119
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,100
When was it taken?

120
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:55,600
That's the exact time I got the address he sent me.

121
00:07:58,100 --> 00:07:59,340
Just before we left,

122
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:01,820
I noticed Luke Wong seemed worried.

123
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:05,040
Let's go.

124
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,900
I'll give you a rundown on how to talk to the witness

125
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:09,240
on the ride over to the station.

126
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:09,940
Right.

127
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:11,580
We all were then.

128
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,660
Which is why I find it hard to believe

129
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:15,340
that he just wanted to capture the view.

130
00:08:15,860 --> 00:08:17,300
He wanted a backup plan.

131
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,480
So he took the photo as a marker,

132
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,180
hoping we'd find it.

133
00:08:22,180 --> 00:08:26,160
He wanted to make sure we still had options.

134
00:08:26,900 --> 00:08:28,540
If things got really bad.

135
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,800
That explains how he was acting at the river.

136
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:35,740
Even with Master Suen's lessons,

137
00:08:36,060 --> 00:08:37,580
Luke Wong's not a strong fighter.

138
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,880
But when he fought Li Tianxi,

139
00:08:40,300 --> 00:08:41,380
he was holding his own.

140
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:48,940
With how impulsive he was,

141
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:51,960
it would make more sense if you were possessing him.

142
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:56,280
So I've already used the photo?

143
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:58,000
Or I will.

144
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:00,160
But what happens if I don't?

145
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:04,120
Would I have gotten on the boat at Li Tianxi?

146
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:05,900
Uh, Captain?

147
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:07,540
What is he talking about?

148
00:09:08,820 --> 00:09:09,300
Look,

149
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,780
they're going through something right now.

150
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:13,740
Do you mind giving us the room?

151
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:14,780
Yeah, sure.

152
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:16,780
Lu Guang,

153
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,800
did you see this coming?

154
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,480
Is that why you couldn't let them take me?

155
00:09:22,180 --> 00:09:35,700
The half-dead idiot is bleeding out all over the floor.

156
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,820
And I don't want to deal with the corpse.

157
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:42,980
We need a way to bring Cheng Xiaoxie here.

158
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:53,180
He's the only thing that matters.

159
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:55,080
Once we have him,

160
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,620
we can rewrite all of it.

161
00:09:57,620 --> 00:10:02,460
You got something?

162
00:10:04,060 --> 00:10:06,140
And you're absolutely sure that it's her?

163
00:10:06,300 --> 00:10:07,220
That it's Li Tianxi?

164
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:09,880
Yes, sir.

165
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:12,840
Police in the Nanda district got a report two days ago.

166
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:15,780
Oh, man.

167
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,380
This place used to be packed.

168
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:18,940
Now it's just abandoned.

169
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,040
Yeah, that's what happens.

170
00:10:21,620 --> 00:10:23,300
People move out and don't come back.

171
00:10:25,060 --> 00:10:25,540
Huh?

172
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:26,460
Hang on.

173
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,140
I think I just heard something.

174
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:29,840
Yeah, so what?

175
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,300
Come on, let's go.

176
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,560
No, listen.

177
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,140
Sounds like someone's in there.

178
00:10:34,820 --> 00:10:36,980
Or it's a ghost and we should leave.

179
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:37,840
What?

180
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,080
Dude, come on.

181
00:10:39,860 --> 00:10:40,400
Let's look.

182
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:42,240
Fine, but you're dying first.

183
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,820
You're too kind.

184
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:46,420
Now lift.

185
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:49,720
Huh?

186
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,560
Still got power.

187
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:53,920
Awesome.

188
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,520
He's the only thing that matters.

189
00:10:56,180 --> 00:10:57,380
Once we have him,

190
00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:59,640
we can rewrite all of it.

191
00:11:00,620 --> 00:11:01,560
Anyone here?

192
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:06,640
Even finding that sister of yours.

193
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,580
Two kids found her

194
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:14,680
when they broke into an abandoned grocery store.

195
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:17,100
She's not in the system,

196
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:18,960
but her physical description

197
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,620
matches with Li Tianxi perfectly.

198
00:11:23,220 --> 00:11:23,940
All right.

199
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:26,220
There's no more room for mistakes.

200
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,860
The police would have found your sister by now.

201
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:33,640
It's a pity.

202
00:11:34,980 --> 00:11:36,220
I can't abide betrayal.

203
00:11:37,380 --> 00:11:38,440
Even from her.

204
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:42,040
She's beyond mercy now.

205
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,520
That can't be our only option.

206
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:49,760
That depends.

207
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:51,660
What would you suggest?

208
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:53,880
What's our new endgame?

209
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:26,740
Captain Shao, please calm down.

210
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:28,800
She's only just arrived at the station.

211
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:30,240
We haven't confirmed it's her.

212
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:33,860
What happened on the boat after you left?

213
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:34,660
Tell me!

214
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,160
Is he safe?

215
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,160
Where is he?

216
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:48,200
Wait, where are you?

217
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:51,480
All right.

218
00:12:51,940 --> 00:12:52,940
Everyone take a breath.

219
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,860
She might not be the Li Tianxi

220
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:55,900
we've been dealing with.

221
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:59,640
Why does everyone keep saying that like it's true?

222
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,560
How is she any different?

223
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:02,560
Sir,

224
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:04,820
she hasn't said a word since she got here.

225
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:07,320
And it's possible she can't.

226
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:08,780
Developmentally,

227
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:10,500
she still seems like a child.

228
00:13:10,500 --> 00:13:26,300
So that's actually her,

229
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,920
and we've been dealing with her brother.

230
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:31,000
But then why would he go through all that trouble?

231
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:33,160
Was it all just to kidnap you?

232
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:35,080
I guess so.

233
00:13:35,780 --> 00:13:38,160
He's likely the one who's been controlling people too.

234
00:13:38,940 --> 00:13:41,240
Not just one at a time either, apparently.

235
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,340
But I never saw him activate his powers.

236
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:48,100
Then use the photo from Lu Guang to find out.

237
00:13:50,780 --> 00:13:53,260
Avoiding history doesn't mean you've changed it.

238
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:55,100
So don't.

239
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:57,840
The past will be just as it was.

240
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,700
A lot could have happened.

241
00:14:01,100 --> 00:14:02,600
But Lu Guang made a choice.

242
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,920
And now that choice is fate.

243
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:08,060
Past or future.

244
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:10,540
Remain untouched.

245
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:15,680
You're right.

246
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:17,140
Thanks.

247
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:20,120
We've been trying to get through to her,

248
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:21,420
but nothing seems to work.

249
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:22,420
Won't even eat.

250
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:24,460
If we push her,

251
00:14:24,580 --> 00:14:26,460
she'll probably shut down and give us nothing.

252
00:14:27,780 --> 00:14:29,020
Let's leave her alone.

253
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:32,000
We can find a psychologist to talk with her in the morning.

254
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:34,620
We don't have that kind of time.

255
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:36,940
Her brother's holding someone hostage.

256
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:37,840
Get help.

257
00:14:38,380 --> 00:14:39,460
And do it fast.

258
00:14:39,780 --> 00:14:40,140
Captain,

259
00:14:40,140 --> 00:14:41,860
I have an idea.

260
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:47,780
Keep making calls in the meantime.

261
00:14:48,940 --> 00:14:49,420
Okay.

262
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,280
I'm gonna need some things.

263
00:14:53,260 --> 00:15:14,660
Hello.

264
00:15:14,660 --> 00:15:18,660
That's fine. You can drink it when you want to.

265
00:15:18,660 --> 00:15:24,660
It's funny, I knew a kid. He used to hate drinking his milk.

266
00:15:26,660 --> 00:15:29,660
There! Drink it!

267
00:15:29,660 --> 00:15:31,660
No! Gross!

268
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:35,660
You don't know that! You haven't even tried it yet!

269
00:15:35,660 --> 00:15:37,660
Don't be a butt and drink it!

270
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:38,660
No way!

271
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:41,660
You're not gonna get tall if you don't drink it!

272
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:43,660
No! That's a lie! You're stupid!

273
00:15:43,660 --> 00:15:45,660
You're the one who's being stupid!

274
00:15:45,660 --> 00:15:48,660
Hey, you're such a jerk, Chow Ling!

275
00:15:48,660 --> 00:15:49,660
You're not my boss!

276
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:50,660
You're just a…

277
00:15:52,660 --> 00:15:55,660
A big, mean, stinky girl tiger!

278
00:15:56,660 --> 00:15:58,660
I'm Cheng Shao Shi!

279
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:00,660
I'm a big dummy with a straw piss nose!

280
00:16:02,660 --> 00:16:03,660
No, I'm not!

281
00:16:03,660 --> 00:16:05,660
I'm gonna make you look so much uglier!

282
00:16:05,660 --> 00:16:07,660
Just watch me!

